There is a huge difference between code that is
structured on its surface, where that structure is
an assist to the human maintainer, and what the
compiler has to do behind the curtain to change that
structure into machine code. Putting the ugly part
where the human can see it just because it is "what
the compiler is going to produce anyway" is
